@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #334155
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #334155
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #334155
skinparam sequenceActivationBackgroundColor #E2E8F0
hide footbox
actor "GUI / CLI" as C
participant "«module»\nremote_incremental" as I
participant "RemoteArchiveClient" as A
participant "RemoteServer" as S
participant "缓存 / 材料包验证\n«module»" as K
participant "本地链恢复\n«module»" as L
note over C,S
前置条件：安全通道和账户会话有效；重连先 BPSEC 握手再 RESUME。
end note
C -> I : RunRemoteRestore(client, cache, snapshot_id, ...)
activate I
I -> A : EnsureChainMaterial：List()
A -> S : LIST
activate S
S --> A : 当前账户 snapshots / error
A --> I : snapshots / error
deactivate S
I -> I : ResolveRemoteChain -> base 到 target
alt 列表 / 元数据链校验失败
 I --> C : false
else 元数据链有效
 loop 逐个链成员 [前序成功]
  I -> K : FetchSnapshotMaterial：核验缓存身份
  K --> I : verified hit / miss
  alt 已验证缓存命中
   I -> I : 复用本地材料
  else 缓存缺失或未通过核验
   I -> A : DownloadArchiveFile(snapshot_id, ...)
   activate A
   A -> S : DOWNLOAD_BEGIN
   S --> A : size / digest / error
   loop 下载块 [前序成功且尚有字节]
    A -> S : DOWNLOAD_CHUNK
    S --> A : chunk
   end
   opt 所有块成功
    A -> S : DOWNLOAD_END
    S --> A : result
   end
   A --> I : 下载结果 / 字节数
   deactivate A
   opt 下载成功
    I -> K : 校验材料包与成员摘要；解包、发布缓存材料
    K --> I : result / archive name
   end
  end
 end
 alt 下载 / 材料验证失败
  I --> C : false；不进入本地恢复
 else 全部材料就绪
  loop 全部成员及相邻父子边
   I -> K : LoadVerifiedSnapshotIdentity；核对\n父文件名 / snapshot id / sidecars
   K --> I : verified / error
  end
  alt 身份或父子边不匹配
   I --> C : false；不发布目标
  else 链材料验证通过
   I -> L : RestoreSnapshotChain(cache, archive_name, destination, ...)
   activate L
   ref over L
    图 11：base + delta overlay + 失败检查 + 发布
    任一增量处理失败时返回 false，停止发布
   end ref
   L --> I : actual restore result / report
   deactivate L
   I --> C : bool / 链长度 / 下载字节数 / report
  end
 end
end
deactivate I

@enduml
